   "title": "Stage 2",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Stage 2 · Generate from the edited score\n\n1. **Load Text File** reads `output/yue2-same-music-new-lyrics/edited_score.abc` written by Stage 1 (or point it at any `.abc`).\n2. A second **Score Editor** lets you tweak the score once more on this canvas (empty = pass through; it saves to `..._stage2.abc`).\n3. Paste the **new lyrics**; use the **LYRIC ALIGNER** to see notes ↔ syllables and fix them by clicking (one `[Section]` per sung section, in order), pick the **song language**, write the **style prompt**. Section mismatches are logged unless `fail_on_mismatch` is on.\n4. Queue. mode `full` keeps the chords from the score; use **Strip Chords** + mode `melody` to let YuE2 re-harmonize.\n\nKSampler: 32 steps, cfg 1, dpm_2 / sgm_uniform. Model: `checkpoints/yue2_3b_bf16.safetensors`."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
